#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:8
msgid "hdmi-cec interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The `hdmi-cec` interface allows a snap to communicate with HDMI Consumer "
"Electronics Control (CEC) devices through a system CEC adapter. It is "
"intended for snaps that need to send commands to, or receive events from, "
"HDMI-connected equipment such as televisions and audio systems."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:13
msgid ""
"The interface provides an implicit system slot on Ubuntu Core and classic "
"systems. The interface is not auto-connected; the user must connect the "
"application plug to the system slot manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:16
msgid "An application snap declares the plug:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:18
msgid ""
"apps:\n"
"  controller:\n"
"    plugs: [hdmi-cec]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:24
msgid "Connect the plug to the implicit system slot with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:26
msgid "snap connect controller-snap:hdmi-cec :hdmi-cec\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:30
msgid ""
"The interface grants access to Linux CEC device nodes such as `/dev/cec0`, "
"as well as legacy platform-specific nodes including `/dev/hdmicec`, `/dev/"
"CEC`, `/dev/aocec`, `/dev/mxc_hdmi_cec` and `/dev/tegra_cec`. It also "
"permits the CEC sysfs discovery and metadata access needed by CEC libraries "
"and selected legacy backends. The available node depends on the hardware, "
"kernel, and enabled driver; not every system provides all of these paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:34
msgid ""
"USB-attached serial CEC adapters are not covered by `hdmi-cec`. Use the {ref}"
"`raw-usb interface <interfaces-raw-usb-interface>` for USB device access."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:36
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:38
msgid ""
"This interface has no plug or slot attributes. Hardware access still "
"requires a supported CEC adapter and driver on the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:40
msgid ""
"The test code can be found in the snapd repository: [hdmi_cec_test.go]"
"(https://github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/"
"hdmi_cec_test.go)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/hdmi-cec-interface.md:42
msgid ""
"The source code for the interface is in the snapd repository: [hdmi_cec.go]"
"(https://github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/"
"hdmi_cec.go)."
msgstr ""
